        "TileImage": "$($repository d37dbe48-0cd8-480d-9d61-28fe8057d3e1).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47. Your Target is Gerard Mann, a sadistic ex-Stasi operative turned elite security consultant, currently at a heavily guarded beach house. Mann historically masked his serial killings as state business, leaving no bodies behind. Our client, a victim&apos;s son, demands poetic justice. Parameters: Eliminate Mann with a surgical knife to the head. Then, hide the body flawlessly. His family must suffer the same agonizing uncertainty as his innocent victims. I will leave you to prepare.",
